<title>CHINA: Tungtex yearly net jumps 93 percent.</title>
<headline>Tungtex yearly net jumps 93 percent.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   18.2	 vs  9.4</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    6.0	  vs  3.5</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  2.94 loss  vs  5.17 loss</p>
<p>    Net			    66.31	vs  34.39</p>
<p>    Turnover		     1,148.73   vs  862.33</p>
<p>    Company name		 Tungtex (Holdings) Co Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  September 10-18</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   September 23</p>
<p>NOTE - Tungtex is a holding company for garment manufacturing, fashion and retail firms. The company proposes a special dividend of 2.0 cents per share vs nil.</p>
<p>Exceptional loss was mainly from loss on sale of interests in certain associated companies in China.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is 10.25 H.K. cents (including interim dividend of 2.25 cents and the special dividend) vs 4.5 cents.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
